# Fintra — code ownership per module.
#
# Each engineer governs (must review/approve changes to) only their package(s).
# Combine with branch protection on `main`:
#   Settings → Branches → add rule for `main` →
#     ☑ Require a pull request before merging
#     ☑ Require review from Code Owners
#     ☑ Dismiss stale approvals, ☑ Require status checks
#
# NOTE (read-access tradeoff): in a single private repo, CODEOWNERS governs
# WRITE/REVIEW, not READ — every collaborator can still read all packages.
# True per-engineer READ isolation would require splitting into separate repos.
# This is an accepted, documented choice to keep monorepo ergonomics.
#
# Replace the @placeholder handles below with real GitHub usernames/teams.

